<title>UK: LIFFE June certified coffee stocks up at 2,346.</title>
<headline>LIFFE June certified coffee stocks up at 2,346.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIFFE coffee certified stocks rose to 2,346 lots in June from 881 lots in May, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The stocks stood at 4,858 lots in April. The sharp fall in end-May stocks was because of a change in the grading system.</p>
<p>Certificates under the old system expired at the end of May and the new system certificates are valid for delivery for the July contract onwards.</p>
<p>-- Jalil Hamid, London newsroom +44 171 542 4985</p>
